      "Description": {
        "Namespace": "",
        "Key": "651213D04E845DEB21CE4FBB9E89C9E0",
        "SourceString": "Devannos is the god of war and hunting, guiding both warriors and hunters with his divine precision. His influence ensures arrows fly true and battles are won in his honor. According to legend, Devannos taught the first hunters how to track and take down prey, his guidance so precise that even novices could not miss. He is said to have intervened in the Battle of Bloodfields, guiding arrows to secure victory for his favored warriors. Some believe Devannos walks among mortals as a silent archer, testing skills and rewarding the worthy.",
